格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 主程序与插件更新管理：npm/GitHub 双源 semver 比对、多语言横幅、一键更新（主程序自动备份/校验/回滚，插件临时目录安装）、更新后看门狗重启。Update management for DeepSeek Harness and its plugins: dual-source semver checks, locale banner, one-click updates with backup/rollback, watchdog restart.","id":"gh:1334836615","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-update-checker","slug":"Airmetro/dsh-update-checker","topics":["cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","update-checker"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 主程序与插件更新管理：npm/GitHub 双源 semver 比对、多语言横幅、一键更新（主程序自动备份/校验/回滚，插件临时目录安装）、更新后看门狗重启。Upda"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"te management for DeepSeek Harness and its plugins: dual-source semver checks, locale banner, one-cl"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ick updates with backup/rollback, watchdog restart."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-update-checker"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A permanent Cordis plugin for the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI that **auto-checks for new DeepSeek Harne"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ss releases and installed third-party plugin updates** (the former standalone `dsh-plugin-checker` w"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"as merged in v1.1.0), asks the user, and one-click updates with success/failure feedback."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Full update lifecycle** — check, backup, update, **rollback**, and restart, all in one plugin.\n-"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" **Main program check** — compares the installed `@deepseek-ai/dsh` against the npm latest (full pac"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"kument, **stable-first**, semver-aware). A pre-release target is installed only when it belongs to t"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"he channel the deployment already follows — a cross-channel promotion (`rc` → `alpha`) is refused wi"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"th `E_PRERELEASE` unless you enable the `allowPrerelease` setting, so the checker never promotes the"},{"id":"p6s6","text":" harness into an unintended pre-release channel.\n- **Third-party plugin check** — scans installed no"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"n-official plugins (layout-agnostic, incl. pnpm-hoisted `node_modules`), cross-compares each against"},{"id":"p6s8","text":" **npm + GitHub** (target = higher version); local tools with no publish source go to `ignored`. Whe"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"n a plugin name has multiple copies, the one in the **composition-owning profile's `node_modules`** "},{"id":"p6s10","text":"wins (the rest are listed as `copies`), and each plugin can be excluded from prompts (`excludedPlugi"},{"id":"p6s11","text":"ns`, re-enableable in the settings page).\n- **Working GitHub channel** — dedicated HTTPS client for "},{"id":"p6s12","text":"GitHub domains (tolerates self-signed local proxies; the npm registry still uses strict TLS), with r"},{"id":"p6s13","text":"edirects, size caps and timeouts; codeload tarballs are validated before install.\n- **In-GUI banner*"},{"id":"p6s14","text":"* — locale-aware (zh/en follows the DSH UI language), states update / up-to-date / failure, with a s"},{"id":"p6s15","text":"uppression flag and a **change brief** (vX→vY + risk level + release notes when available).\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### Host & Client"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **Host** (`lib/index.js`) — HTTP routes: `status.json` (check), `mount.json` (self-mount state), `"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"suppress`, `update` (with `dry` preview), `rollback`, `backups.json`, `restart`, `restart-status.jso"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"n`, `plugins.json`, `plugin-update`, `plugin-rollback`, `plugin-exclude`.\n- **Client** (`lib/client."},{"id":"p8s4","text":"js`) — renders two banners in the root `shell.overlay` slot: a core banner (main-program update stat"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"e) and a plugin banner (updatable plugins with single / update-all buttons). Both check on page load"},{"id":"p8s6","text":", then every 6 hours; the settings page (\"检查更新\") adds rollback buttons."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install & mount"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The package is a profile bundle (its manifest declares `dsh.bundle.patch`)."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### dsh `0.1.6-alpha.2` and later: the profile needs its own link"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Step 1 alone is **no longer enough**. `0.1.6-alpha.2` changed the profile module-resolution\ndefault "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"from `\"link\"` to `\"runtime\"`, which turns `$DSH_HOME/profiles/node_modules` into a\n*shared managed* "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"directory that dsh excludes from Node's native resolve. It now only serves the\ndeployment dependency"},{"id":"p14s4","text":" closure and the selected bundle closure (see `PluginPackages` /\n`routeScoped` in `@deepseek-ai/dsh-"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"app-boot`), and a third-party plugin belongs to neither — so\nthe bare `dsh-update-checker` name stop"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"s resolving and the launch dies with\n`ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND: Cannot find package 'dsh-update-checker'"},{"id":"p14s7","text":" imported from …\\profiles\\web\\`\nbefore the web server binds. (That importer path is *rewritten* by d"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"sh to point at the profile\ndirectory; the real failing base is `$DSH_HOME/package.json`. Do not trus"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"t the path in the\nmessage.) Two things fix it, and both are needed:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"A **junction is required rather than a copy**: the link's real path must stay\n`…/profiles/node_modul"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"es/…`, or `pickDshHome` can no longer recognise the Harness home and the\nplugin's self-location drif"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"ts (which would send its `@deepseek-ai/*` sync to the wrong place).\nThe declaration is what dsh's `r"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"eadProfilePlugins` and this plugin's own\n`findDeclaringProfiles`/`persistPluginUpdate` read to decid"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"e which profile owns the plugin —\nwithout it the plugin reports itself as permanently outdated."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**Step 2 is not optional on a fresh install.** A profile that cannot resolve the plugin dies in\n`com"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"poseProfile` — *before* the plugin is loaded — so no code inside the plugin can repair that\nfirst la"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"unch. Do 2a and 2b by hand when you install (or when you add a second profile), and the\nprofile come"},{"id":"p17s4","text":" Do 2a and 2b by hand when you install (or when you add a second profile), and the\nprofile comes up."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**After that first successful launch the plugin maintains the mount itself.** From v1.6.0 it\nre-runs"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" `ensurePluginMount` at startup, after each plugin update and after each plugin rollback:\nit creates"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" or repairs the link in every profile and writes the declaration into every harness\nprofile, is idem"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"potent, never overwrites a `link:`/`file:` spec you set deliberately, and never\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Configuration & portability"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"All paths are **auto-detected at runtime — nothing is hardcoded**:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Plugin / profile dir** — derived from the plugin's own install location (`import.meta.url`), wit"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"h two escape hatches: in a pnpm `isolated` profile the real path is inside `node_modules/.pnpm/…`, s"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"o the chain is resolved back to the profile's own `node_modules`; and when the plugin is installed o"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"utside a `profiles` tree (npm global) the profile that is actually running (`$DSH_PROFILE_DIR`, `pro"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"files/$DSH_PROFILE`) is preferred. `DSH_UC_PROFILE_NODE_MODULES` overrides the result completely (v1"},{"id":"p21s6","text":".7.3, issue #40).\n- **`$DSH_HOME`** — the parent of the `profiles` root (state, backups, restart log"},{"id":"p21s7","text":" live there).\n- **Composition file** — the profile that is actually running wins: `$DSH_PROFILE_DIR/"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"cordis.patch.yml` → `profiles/$DSH_PROFILE/…` → the profile whose patch names this plugin → `$DSH_HO"},{"id":"p21s9","text":"ME/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`. (v1.6.3; before that the `web` default was used whenever nothing "},{"id":"p21s10","text":"proved otherwise, so a host serving another profile read the wrong `node_modules` — issue #31.)\n[该节后"},{"id":"p21s11","text":"ed otherwise, so a host serving another profile read the wrong `node_modules` — issue #31.)\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
